{"id":"en_the-thorned-rose","title":"The Thorned Rose","titleEn":"The Thorned Rose","description":"Charlotte Lincoln gives up a great deal for her mother and ends up carrying Yannick Jones's child, only to be betrayed by her stepsister and her father. Five years on, she comes back a much stronger woman, and Yannick sets about trying to win her back. The two reconcile and together rescue their daughter from abuse, ending up as a happy family of five. The series and its episodes can be followed on Dramzio.","poster":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-thorned-rose/en_US/4c70d875c2df60ab/cover.webp","backdrop":"https://cdn2.nsstorage.space/the-thorned-rose/en_US/4c70d875c2df60ab/cover.webp","kind":"series","year":2025,"genres":["Second Chance","Sweet","Short Drama"],"featured":false,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dlnq4/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}],"episodes":[{"id":"ep_the-thorned-rose_1","title":"Episode 1","season":1,"number":1,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dlnq4/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-thorned-rose_2","title":"Episode 2","season":1,"number":2,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dlnq4/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-thorned-rose_3","title":"Episode 3","season":1,"number":3,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dlnq4/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-thorned-rose_4","title":"Episode 4","season":1,"number":4,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/v7dlnq4/?pub=4occak","kind":"embed","downloadable":false}]},{"id":"ep_the-thorned-rose_5","title":"Episode 5","season":1,"number":5,"sources":[{"id":"rumble-0","label":"Rumble HD (Ad-Free)","url":"https://rumble.com/embed/